30
00:01:07,798 --> 00:01:09,597
But I'd love to give this year a good run.

31
00:01:09,598 --> 00:01:11,127
- That's right. - Yes. That's why I'm here.

32
00:01:11,128 --> 00:01:12,197
- With that logic, - Yes.

33
00:01:12,198 --> 00:01:13,714
- anyone can join our show. - Gosh, no.

34
00:01:13,738 --> 00:01:15,738
Some people don't want to gallop hard like horses.

35
00:01:15,868 --> 00:01:17,767
Some might want to trot.

36
00:01:17,768 --> 00:01:19,207
(Some might want to trot.)

37
00:01:19,208 --> 00:01:20,778
Tell us how it feels to be on our show.

38
00:01:21,108 --> 00:01:22,907
- I'm a huge fan of the show. - Yes.

39
00:01:22,908 --> 00:01:24,677
So this feels so surreal now.

40
