48
00:01:41,828 --> 00:01:43,297
- Oh, my. - My gosh.

49
00:01:43,298 --> 00:01:44,697
I can't believe I'll see it in person.

50
00:01:44,698 --> 00:01:45,768
- Right. - "Roar."

51
00:01:45,798 --> 00:01:47,067
- Show us. - Please show us.

52
00:01:47,068 --> 00:01:48,768
- Oh, no. - What's your nickname?

53
00:01:49,338 --> 00:01:50,607
It's Little Tiger.

54
00:01:50,608 --> 00:01:52,108
- What? Little? - Little...

55
00:01:52,238 --> 00:01:53,238
Tiger.

56
00:01:53,239 --> 00:01:55,777
(Little Tiger)

57
00:01:55,778 --> 00:01:57,077
- My gosh. - I love it.

58
00:01:57,078 --> 00:01:58,178
- No, I love it. - Oh, my.

59
00:01:58,278 --> 00:01:59,447
- No. - It's great.

60
